<title>USA: ReliaStar splits stock two-for-one.</title>
<headline>ReliaStar splits stock two-for-one.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ReliaStar Financial Corp said Friday  its board of directors approved a two-for-one stock split payable  September 10, 1997, to shareholders of record on August 19, 1997.</p>
<p>As of July 1, 1997, ReliaStar had 46.6 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>ReliaStar is the 12th largest publicly held life insurance holding  company in the United States.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
